  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). Look up a Kepler star by KIC number, download its PDCSAP light curve from MAST, run a fixed preprocessing pipeline and a 1D-CNN to score it as a planet candidate against a calibrated 0.6914 threshold, and optionally run a phase-fold eclipsing-binary check using the star's orbital period. Data used in the run: none. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
